    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "friends and groups don't change the fact that he's not here. they just talk and talk and then i go back to this. it feels like i'm just performing being alive, you know? like i'm just going through the motions of a life that doesn't even belong to me anymore. it feels less like grieving and more like i'm just waiting for something to end.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
