      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's exhausting to keep putting on a show when your insides are crumbling, and that feeling of waiting is so heavy. Sometimes, the performance is just the energy it takes to keep breathing through the day, and that's okay. If the routine feels meaningless, maybe the next step isn't about \"fixing\" the emptiness, but about finding one tiny thing that feels even slightly real to *you*. Don't force yourself to feel better; just allow yourself to feel what is there right now.",
